flowchart LR
 Owner["Web / native: answer"] --> HTTP["HTTP: authentication / validation"]
 HTTP --> Decisions["Decisions: answer + waiting"]
 Decisions --> DB[("SQLite schema10")]
 Decisions --> Events["commit / connection event"]
 Events --> Worker["CallBridgeDeliverer: serial sync"]
 Timer["main.ts: startup / 60-second sync"] --> Worker
 Worker --> Journal["bridge_deliveries: session / seq / terminal / closed"]
 Journal --> DB
 Worker --> Sender["callBridgeSender"]
 Sender --> Bridge["Bridge MCP: open / send / info / hangup"]
 Bridge --> Courier["External courier / gateway"]
 Worker --> Result["Decisions.reportDelivery / UI event"]
 Result --> UI["Web / native reload: waiting / delivered / unknown / fetched"]
 Remote["Remote MCP: explicit get_decision"] --> Decisions
